abstract: >-
  Code, saved observations, evaluation results, protocol records, and a
  saved-result verifier for the study of auditable vulnerability candidate
  ranking and failure analysis in ELF binaries. The archive supports checks
  of reported results but does not include every input needed to rerun all
  binary experiments.
keywords:
